---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
---

<SiteLayout
  title="Fidret — Trust earned."
  description="Fidret is being built around expertise that earns trust: sound judgment, useful work, and reliable delivery. Physical AI is our first practice."
  ogDescription="Expertise that earns trust. Physical AI is our first practice."
  canonical="https://fidret.com/"
>
  <main id="main">
    <section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="hero-label">Expertise with integrity</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title">Clear thinking. <span class="editorial">Lasting value.</span></h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">We’re building Fidret around expertise you can rely on. Sound judgment, useful work, and a commitment to deliver.</p>
        <a class="primary-link" href="#purpose">What guides us</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="purpose-section" id="purpose" aria-labelledby="purpose-title">
      <div class="section-grid shell">
        <h2 id="purpose-title">Expertise that earns trust.</h2>
        <div class="section-copy">
          <p>Clients should be able to rely on our judgment, our work, and our follow-through. That is the company we are building.</p>
          <p>For us, it starts with understanding the real need, making clear commitments, and measuring what the work achieves. We aim to make the reasoning as dependable as the result.</p>
          <p class="name-note">The name Fidret is inspired by the Latin <i lang="la">fīdere</i>: to trust, or to rely upon.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="practice-section shell" id="physical-ai" aria-labelledby="practice-title">
      <div class="practice-heading">
        <p class="section-label">Our first practice</p>
        <h2 id="practice-title">Physical AI.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="practice-copy">
        <p class="practice-lead">Intelligence has to hold up in the physical world.</p>
        <p>We’re developing our first practice around systems that observe physical environments and support decisions or actions within them.</p>
        <p>Our starting point is a concrete problem, a bounded experiment, and evidence of what works under real conditions. We’re laying that foundation now.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="project-section inverse" aria-labelledby="project-title">
      <div class="project-content shell">
        <div>
          <h2 id="project-title">Built with care. From the beginning.</h2>
          <p>Fidret is taking shape. Follow our explorations in Fidret Lab.</p>
        </div>
        <a class="primary-link" href="/lab/">Explore the Lab</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
